    {
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016",
      "name": "Sticky: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 900,
        "height": 180,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Lead onboarding\n**Webhook → validate → dedupe in Google Sheets → create/update row → welcome email → Telegram alert**\n\n1. Fill in the **Config** node (sheet ID, Telegram chat ID, sender email).\n2. Attach credentials to the Google Sheets, SMTP and Telegram nodes.\n3. Set *Settings → Error workflow* to **Error Handler** so failures are reported to Telegram.\n\nInvalid submissions get a `400` response and never touch the CRM."
      }
